Primality takes Number
If Number is 2
Give back true

If Number is 3
Give back true

If Number is 5
Give back true

If Number is 7
Give back true

If Number is 11
Give back true

If Number is 13
Give back true

If Number is 17
Give back true

If Number is 19
Give back true

