Give back true

Give back false

Listen to Text
Cut Text into Chars
Put 0 into Length
While Chars
Roll Chars into Letter
Build Length up

Put Primality taking Length into Result
If Result
Say "You win the game, congratulation !"
Else
Say "Try again..."
